---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
import { breadcrumbSchema } from '../../lib/seo';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title="Cookies on AliquoteIMU.it: What Is Set in Your Browser" description="Cookies and local storage on AliquoteIMU.it: none for the IMU calculators, no audience measurement or advertising tool active, and how to check this in your browser settings." lang={lang} noindex={true} jsonLd={[breadcrumbSchema([{ name: 'Home', path: route('home', lang) }, { name: 'Cookies', path: route('cookies', lang) }])]} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Cookies' }]}>
  <header class="mb-6"><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy-900 md:text-4xl">Cookies</h1></header>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <p>The calculators do not use cookies. Your inputs stay in the page and, if you use the share link, in the page address.</p>
    <p>The site currently loads no audience measurement and no advertising, so it sets no third-party cookies and shows no banner. You can check this in your browser’s site data settings or developer tools.</p>
    <p>If we add a measurement tool in future, we will list here the cookies it sets and how long they last. Questions: see the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a>.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
